# Bush Pilot

Static Three.js game. Entry is `index.html` → `js/main.js` (`Game`).

- Modes: `ON_FOOT` and `IN_AIRCRAFT`. Flight state is `PARKED` or `FLYING` from speed and `airborne`.
- World: `js/terrain.js` (one cay, beach park spawn, solids, water, grass). `js/airport.js`, `js/takeoffManager.js`, `js/landingManager.js`, `js/taxiManager.js`, and `js/landingAid.js` are unused by `main.js`.
- Actors: `js/player.js`, `js/aircraft.js` (power flight), `js/smurf.js` (follows on foot, runs home when boarded), `js/fieldkit.js` (hunger, thirst, stamina, water cans, solar panel, cargo).
- Look: `js/groundfx.js` (prints, ripples, grass contact). Sound: `js/audio.js` (synthesized; `audio/prop.mp3` is not wired yet). Loads: `js/loaders.js`.

Full map and habits: `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/VERIFY.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`.
